  description: Carrier of fungal corruption. Common in marshes and stronghold interiors.
  tier: 0
  family: 5
  behaviors:
  - Walks slowly toward player, suicide-style.
  - Explodes in a poison cloud when killed or close to player.
  - Vulnerable from range only.
  - Often used as 'pushers' to flush player from cover.
